  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:18f82ca8f35487d19a34e584",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f6d09d3bf68ecfe25b03c1bbfa1cc896088838b9b654cf7cddb2ba7226922267",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1132",
        "140017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aa82ab2f037c80fddf18d4f3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯~",
      "source_fingerprint": "ff2c6cff336926856d617b3f7d6f749af916b2fee742ca2798087183a50866ce",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1132",
        "140018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d0652c4ea65ab4b4796b8125",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "说是明天能拿到这个呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "23dc69fb0d668a69b4d043f02768ce12dfe86857e7e2da0d07bec2f472107e4a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1132",
        "15"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6d23898f65ccfae25bd2e7b5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呼哇~\n对休息的爱……好像有点不够呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "106149926bbd958b60d938981eb6d2e180c75e7841d68d1b0bd9db64de532902",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1132",
        "20000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fca1c6c6c5f7516d8fc06bfa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯~用格斗游戏来比喻的话，\n体力值只剩几点了哦……",
      "source_fingerprint": "e07a4c0804c5d8ee1c3eb1dac4eb2dbe12202e4b73bedcd88bf4d5c7ed22970e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1132",
        "20001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:171afa037a6e1cf81bc3477f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天的我充满了大家送来的Love！\n赶快开始准备回礼吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ea576901fdc458bb26c7e7d8f643c654a73b06015ee36e4093d98d66f76a8666",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1132",
        "20002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6a5a3b7f27de274ce956ea1b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "上传视频前稍微跑了一下，\n腿脚比上周轻盈多了……大概是\n多亏了你的Love吧。呵呵。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1ccb9f1b8f0b90a560d317bef44b807baa892ec9d426a4ab47fcd648592496b2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1132",
        "20003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:18a3256d00181f02bf9646ad",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Love me♡ Love you♡ \n今天也要开始啦～♡ ……呵呵，\n偶尔也想试试直播风格的开场呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "58a10a1bea39b577e0a8875e32ae1175d325a6f0414f3d1c42ba52bf75e32f80",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1132",
        "20004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0b25f8f3fb5cb3d080866f21",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "昨天也收到了很多应援评论♪\n也就是说，今天的我……很强哦~",
      "source_fingerprint": "2f8e2345482ab63001fa76d3e9fee64daacf71756e8741a28827e2f1aa4eeedc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1132",
        "20005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7cb27c92d4f835cb4f4def38",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天训练的情况\n我想待会儿把它做成视频。\n得更加努力了呢，呵呵。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f1fd24576c33c94b3879a92645a7a0a651c43ee7a602d30f83046fcde6a05bf7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1132",
        "20006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:07b00a96a6f464f4a07614bc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一边热身，一边在脑内确认一下\n日程表和动作要领……\n嗯，今天状态也不错。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5c8f36ffa62029e83b2e4f6fdad2488d0b8df82813ec2233823ddf7396885408",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1132",
        "20007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:438824ca1b7252c36c8397d4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯～……\n想开一个懒洋洋的长杂谈直播呢~",
      "source_fingerprint": "8651507232b75ee6b33ed6492ebfa5fa3ec48633c0db68d3564b410cdd1e4acd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1132",
        "20008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ba431cbf2b536259ba767c8a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "直播时还跟大家说了\n『状态绝佳！』来着……抱歉。\n可能还是有点逞强了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1749e6ba0752933aff3b70753ec38738b518bb338b1691272fb893c963bae2ee",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1132",
        "20009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0f87014e3acf70004dac5723",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……啊，抱歉…刚才没看到评论栏\n……咦？现在还在训练中呢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "54720d3be4f281c982a26bed54d3a849354b227993c8d1c8945d876ef6a203ca",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1132",
        "20010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0dcb7dc215528f3b334c1c00",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……稍微，稍微多一点，\n你的Love，可以让我比平时\n得到更多一点吗……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "90fa766048b557ca5331277387e533e9f645889c2743e7ad003d8d4acfcfd590",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1132",
        "20011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:47792f5f78566043f34dae07",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我觉得吧……\n不顾一切地散播Love是不行的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1211859536c10a1a3a64b28c3b39d42c891b900b8ecc81656fd9e86e1f6c213b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1132",
        "20021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e0757eda0ff24b8dfa463de0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……这种做法……\n是没有“爱”的吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "72689040df37a159064b774c351d26c9a7cbf1aac4ee431b1dec48d0c6c35bcf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1132",
        "20022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4da7748f105a4ba39f47fac5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "看得见和看不见的力量。\n增长了的实力和得到的Love。\n现在的我大概是无敌的吧。呵呵♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "5fdb9083298955e5215a1f581d9563adc325bb6ad9f3e8840c306f630b147094",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1132",
        "20023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5f067dbb68f12b73e9cbc791",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "现在，存在于我心中的是大家的爱\n和你的爱。至于这些爱有多少……\n就让我来展现给你吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "12bc51f2c064df560a085f4b68aa0d2a28b33ccc9d6172e34eaf1d5e9ae4c749",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1132",
        "20024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:86a311b80659ad2aa13cc34a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天又要再证明一次了呢。\n你就是我通往梦想的“桥梁”♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "48992138a117cc5ee8d801141b8aa14070a7d71df1cc0b37e3725c37a10a73c8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1132",
        "20025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:898995fa67c6a5f22c310dde",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赛场上、还有画面前的大家，\n等着哦……\n我这就把“爱”回报给你们。",
      "source_fingerprint": "58d880688a1b721c0bae0ac6c95833f9d32a5b2fe579f204990b37ae37b14243",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1132",
        "20026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7ac5146ad38c4aab2b8c548a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "鼓励的留言让手机不停震动。\n……我也在发抖。\n这就是所谓的临阵抖擞吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "96dae6c44b152b55bf4b9325ed4faf630fb12cb4c1c859dc45da50765ee854a3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1132",
        "20027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5827b52dd43386444362fea4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今晚的节目已经安排好了，\n直播的比赛跟拍，就拜托了。\n……我绝对，不会让大家失望的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "41fa5afedca068ffd0bf4bf63012d81074ba7c8066cb21c866f918e41b996c7f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1132",
        "20028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:899165c3f108415a1c06193a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赛前的预开闸虽然很短暂……\n不过太好了，\n紧张感一下子就消失了呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "af36f99913bb7c24358fe9045119477ab1eded16b454a50deff545a20125a347",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1132",
        "20029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d2602fd92799167627c0502c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Love me♡  Love you♡\n……就是因为要正式比赛了，\n才更应该“像往常一样”对吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bcec56028f3f7a38227289cc5795faa7ef1bbfbc3c4592388f45ac792690fb39",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1132",
        "20030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:957b466daac2bd2f5f0a7351",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "社区民的大家，准备好\n接收我的“爱”之回报了吗？\n呵呵。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ea7dc69a5b4d050119d13fd6a4f0334ca360ae43625c094bdcc040eaeef5063c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1132",
        "20031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:334a5008afb746df8e06b952",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然身体有点沉重……\n不过还有Love寄宿在\n我的心里和腿上。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dc2e6a8e85acfe20c1992a2f76c9c4cf7e14df4bd9b5ca415442362def86a261",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1132",
        "20032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:22ce081356f616bc596098db",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "没事的，别担心。\n我相信我自己。\n我相信被大家爱着的我。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e846e16cdfaa322f35a1ae2be46afbd8180fc7c1f66fc7e5b4b24e34654652ad",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1132",
        "20033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:50796c9da269a8e8adac79ed",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感觉有点不安呢……不过，\n我还有着想传达Love的心情。\n……没问题，不会输的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1221e82e6bc99ef4c708b2376d0e646833878d67612a15b3268f6e133c501295",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1132",
        "20034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fc15e8a1540072451c39e531",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "直播时大家都为我担心……\n既然已经回复了『没事的！』\n那就得说到做到才行呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6de29b52c83385c011f3ff42ca589a0fbc6995b1deef415038138b0d11b09cd8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1132",
        "20035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2c4e2b67dbbf1bfe1e0ef613",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然不一定全都能\n按计划进行……但是……\n收到的“爱”毫无疑问是真实的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f512905867c4e69976f5d4dbf63b2943b292d94f8c6288b4c6b2bc0162a927ab",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1132",
        "20036"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bc7e3d15231f80f821d64db5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……请在我身旁，守护着我，\n相信我。这样的话，\n我……就能变得坚强起来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "347727dd4ba17af548d0f3220718ba35dcc362387f438533b29b8cc079650543",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1132",
        "20037"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1f304e74d83aad4ba10e57e9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要上了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1517fbd3c7a4b1a9bc6c0f2a21ca4dcc3ad0db20e4ce267cdba0767e3af1e843",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1132",
        "20038"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b9badfa415d3e8017b237d5a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "LoveLove~♡",
      "source_fingerprint": "415f44d99c40d95338098737b20bc1626ed3d24b65b0b54b30081f3b27c90ad8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1132",
        "20039"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8d11908b1afaf6d3be207549",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好了好了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "601c20e7e5ebf233b16efb4924c0b5cbd646f6a47e35770c6c4c666226122402",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1132",
        "20040"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2f18506b271f69867abb395c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯嗯！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c4c286c02f62355c7d41f684d51a8da2d669df1770b3dc820cfa123a9cd2be1b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1132",
        "20041"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:218f388a4676a2cc65ecd061",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "咦~？",
      "source_fingerprint": "0d8438c1fc77c355c18b07b006a145668d9bf25fc67ca40b284106eb53c51202",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1132",
        "20042"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:626612153f6690f6732fbffa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀呀~",
      "source_fingerprint": "63316668405685c4790183542736f8096a8820d19621297110791ba126ca7e1b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1132",
        "20043"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:319bc95d323d3b3671041f4c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "出发！",
      "source_fingerprint": "663f67e6d36e16231932887bb1e3eb2db26e1fb205d758f58e5da16072deb3e7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1132",
        "20046"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9811c4bb9c1ca2278a50e834",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Love之旅~♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "038c89674d5bced76565412d1257ba63e887f01c9c48b1eaa0787aa96ad34aea",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1132",
        "20047"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7dfc61997bed6c42f0e57a40",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你的Love，我收到了很多呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f150bd6b7bde5c0f6e223e77476a3d70df35af863bdb93a6cc5de0f6e331df34",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1132",
        "20049"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:071a0df15346cb3a1e662fb7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "很开心的一次旅程呢～",
      "source_fingerprint": "9e71f2ef41e2e6ad4ba3347e356a9c8c44e7ec7df9bdd61b93f93cc38c9da59a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1132",
        "20050"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4f03efefc2eac2a6e704a0c6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "上传视频前稍微跑了一下，\n腿脚比上周轻盈多了……大概是\n多亏了你的Love吧。呵呵。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1ccb9f1b8f0b90a560d317bef44b807baa892ec9d426a4ab47fcd648592496b2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1132",
        "20103"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a4c74826e81872957f034eb0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……稍微，稍微多一点，\n你的Love，可以让我比平时\n得到更多一点吗……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "90fa766048b557ca5331277387e533e9f645889c2743e7ad003d8d4acfcfd590",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
